quot;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\">AuthServer=&quot;http://123.60.161.29:30929&quot;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\">ApiBase=&quot;http://123.60.161.29:30929&quot;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\">OsClientRedisHost=&quot;123.60.161.29&quot;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\">OsClientRedisPort=30827</span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: nowrap;\\\">OsClientRedisPwd=&quot;j_Microi1354dhsIUTYURTU_ZK3Dp7&quot;</span></p><p><br/></p>\",\"RichText33\":null,\"XiangguanWJ\":\"[]\"},{\"Id\":\"3ee387f3-75fb-4c5d-a5f0-b0bfe4ce3326\",\"CreateTime\":\"2022-08-19 15:45:00\",\"UpdateTime\":\"2024-03-23 23:55:06\",\"UserId\":\"c74d669c-a3d4-11e5-b60d-b870f43edd03\",\"IsDeleted\":0,\"XiangmuBH\":53,\"XiangmuMC\":\"综讯固资管理\",\"XiangmuFZR\":\"{\\\"Id\\\":\\\"d88673ea-ca80-4738-aaf0-2cba5f526e77\\\",\\\"Xingming\\\":\\\"张恒志\\\",\\\"Bumen\\\":\\\"实施部\\\",\\\"Gangwei\\\":\\\"工程师\\\"}\",\"YujiWCRQ2\":\"\",\"ShijiWCRQ\":\"\",\"Beizhu\":\"\",\"ParentId\":null,\"UserName\":\"管理员\",\"ShifouYWC\":\"否\",\"Switch75\":null,\"Guid14\":null,\"CanyuR\":\"[]\",\"ShuomingWD\":\"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><strong>-------2024-03-04 Windows安装方法</strong></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">1、安装环境：准备好redis、mysql（帐号root）、mongodb的密码。</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">2、使用【Navicat Premium 15】连接数据库，创建数据库（字符集utf8mb4、排序规则utf8mb4_general_ci），还原数据库。</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">3、运行【iTdos.Tool.exe】获取HID（硬件ID），发给运维人员获取license文件</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">4、下载【api接口系统】，修改【appsettings.json】里面的配置（注意每行后面都有一个逗号，并且最后一行不能有逗号）：<br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClient&quot;: &quot;zongxungz&quot;,&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientType&quot;: &quot;Product&quot;,&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientNetwork&quot;: &quot;Internal&quot;,&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientDbConn&quot;: &quot;Data Source=数据库IP地址（本地可填写127.0.0.1或localhost）;Database=数据库名称;User Id=数据库帐号;Password=数据库密码;Port=数据库端口号;Convert Zero Datetime=True;Allow Zero Datetime=True;Charset=utf8mb4;Max Pool Size=500;&quot;,</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientRedisHost&quot;: &quot;RedisIP地址<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">（本地可填写127.0.0.1或localhost）</span>&quot;,</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientRedisPort&quot;: &quot;Redis端口号&quot;,</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientRedisPwd&quot;: &quot;Redis密码&quot;,</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;AuthServer&quot;: &quot;http://API接口系统地址<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">（本地可填写127.0.0.1或localhost，注意后面的端口号就是执行#dotnet --urls的端口号）</span>:1000&quot;</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">5、将lincense文件放到【api接口系统】的根目录，然后cmd执行：#dotnet Microi.net.Api.dll --urls=http://0.0.0.0:1000（如果dotnet没有成功设置系统变量时，可使用dotnet&nbsp;D:\\\\完整路径\\\\Microi.net.Api.dll&nbsp;）【这一步程序可能会报错找不到Microi.net.dll文件，将Microi.net.dll文件复制到c:\\\\Program Files\\\\dotnet下即可】</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">6、下载【api定制接口系统】，修改appsesstings.json里面的配置：&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClient&quot;: &quot;zongxungz&quot;,&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientType&quot;: &quot;Product&quot;,&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;OsClientNetwork&quot;: &quot;Internal&quot;,&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">&quot;OsClientDbConn&quot;: &quot;Data Source=数据库IP地址（本地可填写127.0.0.1或localhost）;Database=数据库名称;User Id=数据库帐号;Password=数据库密码;Port=数据库端口号;Convert Zero Datetime=True;Allow Zero Datetime=True;Charset=utf8mb4;Max Pool Size=500;&quot;,</span></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">&quot;DbConnection&quot;: &quot;同上&quot;</span></span></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">7、<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">将lincense文件放到【api定制接口系统】的根目录，然后cmd执行：#dotnet ZongXun.Api.dll --urls=</span><a href=\\\"http://0.0.0.0:1001\\\" target=\\\"_self\\\">http://0.0.0.0:1001</a></span></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;访问：<a href=\\\"http://127.0.0.1:1001/swagger/index.html\\\">http://127.0.0.1:1001/swagger/index.html</a>&nbsp;查看是否成功</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">8、安装nodejs：<a href=\\\"https://www.nodejs.com.cn/\\\">https://www.nodejs.com.cn/</a> </p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">9、下载【os前端系统】和【os前端微服务定制系统】，分别进入根目录，</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 修改index.html中的【var ApiBase = &#39;&#39;;】为【var ApiBase = &#39;http://局域网IP:1000&#39;;】</span></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;修改index.html中的【var OsClient = &#39;&#39;;】为【</span>var OsClient = &#39;zongxungz&#39;;】</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">修改index.html中的【<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">var ApiCustom = &#39;&#39;;</span>】为【<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">var <span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">ApiCustom</span> = &#39;http://局域网IP:1001&#39;;</span>】</span></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">10、分别进入根目录执行命令：</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;#npm install -g http-server（只需要执行1次，或者下载【http-server-14.1.1.tgz】文件，执行#<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">npm install -g <span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">http-server-14.1.1.tgz</span></span>）&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;#http-server --cors -p 1002（os前端系统）</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;#http-server --cors -p 1003（<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">os前端微服务定制系统</span>）</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><br/></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">11、访问【http://127.0.0.1:1002/#/system-config】，修改系统配置中--开发配置--接口地址【http://<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">局域网IP</span>:1000】，定制接口url【http://<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">局域网IP</span>:1001】</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">12、访问【http://127.0.0.1:1002/#/micori-service】，修改【<span style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: right; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">微服务地址</span>】为【http://<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">局域网IP</span>:1003】</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\">13、访问【http://127.0.0.1:1002/#/osclients】，修改【AuthServer】为【http://局域网IP:1000】，修改【<span style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">RedisHost</span>】为【局域网IP】，修改【<span style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">RedisPort</span>】为【Redis端口】，修改【<span style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">RedisPwd</span>】为【Redis密码】</span></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: right;\\\">14、访问【http://127.0.0.1:1002/#/zichanguanli】，修改【<span style=\\\"color: #606266; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">导入接口替换</span>】的url前缀为【http://局域网IP:1001】，修改【<span style=\\\"color: #606266; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">导入进度接口替换</span>】的url前缀为【<span style=\\\"color: #303133; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: right; background-color: #FFFFFF;\\\">http://局域网IP:1001</span>】</span></p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 49, 51); font-fa