\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"864d7d70-dc08-4d65-a570-52985f62\",\"YujiWCRQ2\":\"\",\"ShijiWCRQ\":\"\",\"Beizhu\":\"公司私有化仓库harbor的相关信息\",\"ParentId\":null,\"UserName\":\"虞翰霖\",\"ShifouYWC\":\"是\",\"Switch75\":null,\"Guid14\":null,\"CanyuR\":\"[]\",\"ShuomingWD\":\"<p style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\">Harbor</p><ol class=\\\" list-paddingleft-2\\\" style=\\\"width: 1270.14px; text-wrap: wrap;\\\"><li><p>官网下载离线安装包,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 目前安装包存放于测试服务器59.110.139.96上 目录为：/home/yhl/harbor/harbor-offline-installer-v2.7.3.tgz</p></li><li><p>上传至服务器并解压</p></li><li><p>修改harbor.yml文件，修改hostname，http port，https port证书路径，若不使用https则先注释https</p></li><li><p>执行 ./install.sh脚本</p></li><li><p>运行docker-compose up -d</p></li><li><p>WEB访问&nbsp; hostname(ip) + port ，账号密码存于harbor.yml文件中</p></li></ol><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>登录界面后，可新建项目和账号用于区分限制管理不同客户的仓库，推送镜像可以在项目里 右上角的推送命令中看到。</p><p>举例：docker tag xx:latest dockerhub.microi.net/veken-prod/microi.veken.os:1.0.0 然后push</p><p>此处要注意 若不使用https,而是使用 http://ip+port的形式，会推送失败! 解决方案为需要在docker中配置 参考如下：<span style=\\\"color: #383A42; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #FAFAFA;\\\">/etc/docker/daemon.json</span></p><ol class=\\\"hljs-ln list-paddingleft-2\\\" style=\\\"list-style-type: none;\\\"><li><p>{</p></li><li><p><span class=\\\"hljs-string\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #50A14F; overflow-wrap: break-word;\\\">&nbsp;&quot;insecure-registries&quot;: [</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\\\"hljs-string\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #50A14F; overflow-wrap: break-word;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&quot;192.168.3.193:35080&quot;</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\\\"hljs-string\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #50A14F; overflow-wrap: break-word;\\\">&nbsp; ]</span></p></li><li><p>}</p></li></ol><p>配置文件重载并重启docker （不重启docker应该也可以，只要重载配置文件就行）</p><p>systemctl daemon-reload &amp;&amp; systemctl restart docker &amp;&amp; systemctl enable docker</p><p><br/></p><p>#关于push地址</p><p>可修改harbor.yml里的external_url 修改为你想要的域名如dockerhub.microi.net，默认这个是注释的，若注释，push的地址就会变为 配置中的 hostname +port</p><p><br/></p><p>#公司的harbor部署的服务器暴露的地址为:</p><p><a href=\\\"http://59.110.139.96:31058\\\">http://59.110.139.96:31058</a>&nbsp;(强制重定向到了下面的https)</p><p><a href=\\\"https://59.110.139.96:31059\\\">https://59.110.139.96:31059</a></p><p>然后配置了dockerhub.microi.net的域名指向服务器，通过服务器的宝塔面板nginx配置的反向代理</p><p><br/></p>\",\"ZhanghaoMM\":\"<p>部署在测试服务器<br/></p><p>59.110.139.96</p><p>#测试服harbor</p><p>https://dockerhub.microi.net</p><p>admin / Microi#@!Harbor123654</p><p><br/></p><p>客户子账号：</p><p>#维科集团</p><p>veken / Veken@654123</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\",\"RichText33\":null,\"XiangguanWJ\":\"[]\"},{\"Id\":\"a005983d-6e1f-412e-9cd7-9568115defe0\",\"CreateTime\":\"2023-11-20 09:45:05\",\"UpdateTime\":\"2024-01-26 10:20:30\",\"UserId\":\"c74d669c-a3d4-11e5-b60d-b870f43edd03\",\"IsDeleted\":0,\"XiangmuBH\":72,\"XiangmuMC\":\"仁合吃喝玩乐\",\"XiangmuFZR\":\"{\\\"Name\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"Name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\