\",\"YujiWCRQ2\":\"2021-12-22\",\"ShijiWCRQ\":\"\",\"Beizhu\":\"\",\"ParentId\":null,\"UserName\":\"管理员\",\"ShifouYWC\":\"否\",\"Switch75\":null,\"Guid14\":null,\"CanyuR\":\"[{\\\"Id\\\":\\\"f300ae82-10a8-49f6-aec5-2202bbc881af\\\",\\\"Xingming\\\":\\\"杨相阳\\\",\\\"Bumen\\\":\\\"研发部\\\",\\\"Gangwei\\\":\\\"工程师\\\"},{\\\"Id\\\":\\\"02c69d1c-a025-4ec3-860b-365d305859d3\\\",\\\"Xingming\\\":\\\"修继元\\\",\\\"Bumen\\\":\\\"研发部\\\",\\\"Gangwei\\\":\\\"工程师\\\"},{\\\"Id\\\":\\\"6dcbbce8-0ad6-411e-ad34-ea8f167d89b0\\\",\\\"Xingming\\\":\\\"刘姣姣\\\",\\\"Bumen\\\":\\\"研发部\\\",\\\"Gangwei\\\":\\\"工程师\\\"}]\",\"ShuomingWD\":\"<p>服务器</p><p>ssh：192.168.0.70（客户本地）</p><p>username：root</p><p>端口：22</p><p>密码：lilong2022</p><p><br/></p><p>BasicAuth：http://192.168.0.70:8888/38f4cf80</p><p>username: dd4jozvh</p><p>password: c2587fd0</p><p><br/></p><p>数据库</p><p>地址：59.110.139.96</p><p>数据库：microi_lilong</p><p>端口：3307</p><p>账号：microi_lilong</p><p>密码：123456</p><p><br/></p><p>Redis：</p><p>RedisHost：&quot;59.110.139.96&quot;/&quot;172.17.18.157&quot;,</p><p>RedisPort = &quot;6380&quot;,</p><p>RedisPwd = &quot;Onlyone2Redis&quot;,</p><p>RedisDataBase = &quot;5&quot;,</p><p><br/></p><p>项目文档</p><p>https://www.tapd.cn/</p><p>https://docs.qq.com/s/iADvqD0D-bsUOKLaAVDX6a</p><p><br/></p><p>部署方式</p><p>#docker login --username=admin@itdos.com registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com</p><p>然后输入密码iTdos#docker.publish</p><p><br/></p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api.itdos.com:latest</p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os.itdos.com:latest</p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>#docker run -e &quot;OsClient=hyj&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=LilongServer&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1060:80 --name api.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>#docker run -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1050:80 --name os.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>#docker run -e &quot;OsClient=hyj&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=LilongServer&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1061:80 --name auth.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>docker自动更新</p><p>#docker run -itd --name watchtower --privileged=true --restart=always -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /root/.docker/config.json:/config.json -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock containrrr/watchtower --cleanup --include-stopped --interval 10 api.itdos.com os.itdos.com auth.itdos.com</p><p><br/></p><p>docker stop watchtower</p><p>docker rm watchtower</p><p>再执行上面的duocker run watchtower</p><p><br/></p><p>数据库的安装：</p><p>安装MySql</p><p>命令执行：</p><p>#docker pull mysql:latest</p><p>#docker run -itd --name mysql8 --restart=always -v /home/mysql8/data:/var/lib/mysql -p 3307:3306 -e MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=Lilong#mySql8 -e TZ=Asia/Shanghai mysql:latest --lower-case-table-names=1</p><p>进入Mysql：</p><p>#sudo docker exec -it mysql8 bash</p><p>#mysql -h localhost -u root -p</p><p>就可以管理mysql了</p><p>----------------------------------</p><p>安装Redis：</p><p>#docker pull redis:latest</p><p>#docker run -itd --name redis6 -p 6380:6379 redis:latest --requirepass Lilong*reDis6</p><p>----------------------------------</p><p>安装 MongoDB：</p><p>#docker pull mongo:latest</p><p>#docker run -itd --name mongo4 -p 27018:27017 mongo:latest --auth</p><p>进入mongodb的docker</p><p>#docker exec -it mongo4 mongo root</p><p>#use admin</p><p>创建用户</p><p>#db.createUser({user: &#39;root&#39;, pwd: &#39;Lilong#mongo.4&#39;, roles: [&#39;root&#39;]})</p><p>测试连接，返回1</p><p>#db.auth(&#39;root&#39;, &#39;Lilong#mongo.4&#39;)</p><p><br/></p><p>minio</p><p>#docker run -p 5080:9000 -p 5081:9001 --name lilong-minio \\\\</p><p>-e &quot;MINIO_ROOT_USER=minioLilong&quot; \\\\</p><p>-e &quot;MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=minioLilong&quot; \\\\</p><p>-v /data/minio/data:/data \\\\</p><p>-v /data/minio/config:/root/.minio \\\\</p><p>-d minio/minio server /data --console-address &quot;:9001&quot;</p><p><br/></p><p>程序的部署：</p><p><br/></p><p>微服务</p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/lilong-microi.microi.net:latest</p><p>#docker run -e &quot;OsClient=lilong&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=LilongServer&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1092:80 --name lilong-microi.microi.net --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/lilong-microi.microi.net:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>OS</p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os.itdos.com:latest</p><p>#docker run -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 5005:80 --name os.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>Auth</p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com:latest</p><p>#docker run -e &quot;OsClient=lilong&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=LilongServer&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 5007:80 --name auth.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>API</p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api.itdos.com:latest</p><p>#docker run -e &quot;OsClient=lilong&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=LilongServer&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 5006:80 --name api.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>力隆API</p><p><br/></p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-lilong.microi.net:latest</p><p>#docker run -e &quot;OsClient=lilong&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=LilongServer&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1093:80 --name api-lilong.microi.net --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-lilong.microi.net:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>打印界面</p><p>#docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/view-lilong.microi.net:latest</p><p>#docker run -e &quot;OsClient=lilong&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=LilongServer&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1094:80 --name view-lilong.microi.net --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/view-lilong.microi.net:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>watchtower</p><p>#docker run -itd --name watchtower --privileged=true --restart=always -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /root/.docker/config.json:/config.json -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock containrrr/watchtower --cleanup --include-stopped --interval 10 api.itdos.com os.itdos.com auth.itdos.com lilong-microi.microi.net api-lilong.microi.net view-lilong.microi.net</p><p><br/></p><p>#docker stop watchtower</p><p>#docker rm watchtower</p><p>再执行上面的duocker run watchtower</p><p><br/></p>\",\"ZhanghaoMM\":\"<p>公网地址：http://lilong.microi.net/</p><p>本地地址：http://192.168.0.70:5005/&nbsp;</p><p>帐号：admin</p><p>密码：1234567</p><p><br/></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">git地址</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">api：https://git.itdos.net:99/liujiaojiao/lilongapi</p><p><br/></p>\",\"RichText33\":null,\"XiangguanWJ\":null},{\"Id\":\"d3a725c2-2f4b-46c3-9851-0ee1725a33da\",\"CreateTime\":\"2020-09-03 15:32:06\",\"UpdateTime\":\"2021-02-16 17:23:41\",\"UserId\":\"c74d669c-a3d4-11e5-b60d-b870f43edd03\",\"IsDeleted\":0,\"XiangmuBH\":16,\"XiangmuMC\":\"iPlan-林总\",\"XiangmuFZR\":\"{\\\"Id\\\":\\\"dff38d9b-019f-4ea6-b139-36ff38bb5cb3\\\",\\\"Xingming\\\":\\\"周浩\\\",\\\"YuangongBH\\\":\\\"001\\\",\\\"Bumen\\\":\\\"{\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\\\\"BumenMC\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"研发部\\\\\\\"\\\\r\\\\n}\\\",\\\"Gangwei\\\":\\\"{\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\\\\"GangweiMC\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"总监\\\\\\\"\\\\r\\\\n}\\\",\\\"RuzhiSJ\\\":\\\"2015-12-24\\\"}\",\"YujiWCRQ2\":\"\",\"ShijiWCRQ\":\"\",\"Beizhu\":\"\",\"ParentId\":null,\"UserName\":\"管理员\",\"ShifouYWC\":\"是\",\"Switch75\":null,\"Guid14\":null,\"CanyuR\":null,\"ShuomingWD\":null,\"ZhanghaoMM\":null,\"RichText33\":null,\"XiangguanWJ\":null},{\"Id\":\"d9bf88ea-29c1-4406-bae9-dc9c389aab71\",\"CreateTime\":\"2020-06-19 22:58:04\",\"UpdateTime\":\"2020-09-03 15:26:11\",\"UserId\":\"c74d669c-a3d4-11e5-b60d-b870f43edd03\",\"IsDeleted\":0,\"XiangmuBH\":12,\"XiangmuMC\":\"Nas全新开发\",\"XiangmuFZR\":\"{\\n  \\\"Id\\\": \\\"dff38d9b-019f-4ea6-b139-36ff38bb5cb3\\\",\\n  \\\"Xingming\\\": \\\"周浩\\\"\\n}\",\"YujiWCRQ2\":\"2020-09-01 00:00:00\",\"ShijiWCRQ\":\"\",\"Beizhu\":\"\",\"ParentId\":null,\"UserName\":null,\"ShifouYWC\":\"否\",\"Switch75\":null,\"Guid14\":null,\"CanyuR\":null,\"ShuomingWD\":null,\"ZhanghaoMM\":null,\"RichText33\":null,\"XiangguanWJ\":null},{\"Id\":\"db357209-51bc-4fb0-88b8-326bcf2a6b54\",\"CreateTime\":\"2020-06-19 22:55:18\",\"UpdateTime\":\"2022-08-19 19:23:12\",\"UserId\":\"c74d669c-a3d4-11e5-b60d-b870f43edd03\",\"IsDeleted\":0,\"XiangmuBH\":1,\"XiangmuMC\":\"爱居房产平台\",\"XiangmuFZR\":\"{\\\"Id\\\":\\\"183d3590-bd8c-412d-93b1-5bf40562268c\\\",\\\"Xingming\\\":\\\"黎旭贵\\\"}\",\"YujiWCRQ2\":\"2020-07-15 00:00:00\",\"ShijiWCRQ\":\"\",\"Beizhu\":\"林总\",\"ParentId\":null,\"UserName\":null,\"ShifouYWC\":\"否\",\"Switch75\":null,\"Guid14\":null,\"CanyuR\":\"[]\",\"ShuomingWD\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">C端（旧） git &nbsp;https://git.itdos.net:99/Anderson/aiju-front-c-client</p><p>C端（新） git &nbsp;https://git.itdos.net:99/Shuxinxin/aiju-c-v2</p><p>swagger https://api-3.aijuhome.com/swagger/index.html</p><p>新版除四个房源详情外没有翻新外，其他都已经差不多了</p><p>C端微信小程序 ：爱居好房，管理员是林总</p><p>网站：https://www.aijuhome.com/</p><p>网站前端代码是和后端合二为一了 git &nbsp;https://git.itdos.net:99/itdos/ajhome-server</p><p>M端代码也在上面的git地址下的iTods.AijuhomeMobileWeb文件夹下</p><p><br/></p><p>爱居好房：更懂宁波的房产服务大平台。深耕宁波8年，房源更真实，服务更贴近。</p><p>一站服务：涵盖买房、租房、售房、评测、装修等全链本土化服务。</p><p>真实房源：包括二手房、新房、租房、商业、办公等，巨量房源并确保真实有效。</p><p>VR看房：足不出户，全面感受房屋的每一处细节。</p><p>智能搜索：根据客户的需求，适配区域、关键字、地图、地铁、配套、画圈等各种类型的高效搜索方式，一键直达。</p><p>好房推荐：定期汇总精选好房，为客户提供更高的价值。</p><p>售房委托：线上登记，专业经纪人跟进，线上房源管理，高效省心。</p><p>实时行情：最新市场动态新鲜送达，最新成交信息专家评测，完善的房源成交信息发布，你想了解的，就是我们努力的方向。</p><p>房产知识：从房屋买卖到装修设计，涵盖各类专业知识库，提供在线咨询通道，爱居经纪人专业解答您的问题，为您提供全维度服务。</p><p>生活灵感：从心发现生活，和房子产生的温暖故事，让我们一起分享。装修、好物、派对、潮流……</p><p>爱居好房，为你找到心的美好生活。</p><p><br/></p>\",\"ZhanghaoMM\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">爱居客户端<br/></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">地址：<a href=\\\"https://aijuhome.com/\\\">https://aijuhome.com/</a></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><br/></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">爱居后台</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">地址：<a href=\\\"https://os.aijuhome.com/\\\" style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 宋体; color: #003884; font-size: 14px;\\\">https://os.aijuhome.com/</span></a></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">帐号：<span style=\\\"color:#003884;font-family:宋体\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\">admin</span></span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#003884;font-family:宋体\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\">密码：</span></span><span style=\\\"background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #171A1D; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\\\">Aijuhome#com</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #171A1D; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\\\"><br/></span></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #171A1D; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\\\"></span></p><p style=\\\