018</p><p>账号<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>root</p><p>密码<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>iTdos%23mongo.4</p><p><br/></p><p>MinIO</p><p>地址<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>183.249.115.249</p><p>端口<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>5080</p><p>账号<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>minioadmin</p><p>密码<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>minioadmin</p><p><br/></p><p>安装MySql</p><p>命令执行：</p><p>#docker pull mysql:latest</p><p>#docker run -itd --name mysql8 --restart=always -v /home/mysql8/data:/var/lib/mysql -p 3307:3306 -e MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=iTdos#mySql8 -e TZ=Asia/Shanghai mysql:latest --lower-case-table-names=1</p><p>进入Mysql：</p><p>#sudo docker exec -it mysql8 bash</p><p>#mysql -h localhost -u root -p</p><p>就可以管理mysql了</p><p>----------------------------------</p><p>安装Redis：</p><p>#docker pull redis:latest</p><p>#docker run -itd --name redis6 --restart=always -p 6380:6379 redis:latest --requirepass iTdos*reDis6</p><p>----------------------------------</p><p>安装 MongoDB：</p><p>#docker pull mongo:latest</p><p>#docker run -itd --name mongo4 --restart=always -p 27018:27017 -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts mongo:latest --auth</p><p>进入mongodb的docker</p><p>#docker exec -it mongo4 bash</p><p>#use admin</p><p>创建用户</p><p>#db.createUser({user: &#39;root&#39;, pwd: &#39;iTdos#mongo.4&#39;, roles: [&#39;root&#39;]})</p><p>测试连接，返回1</p><p>#db.auth(&#39;root&#39;, &#39;iTdos#mongo.4&#39;)</p><p><br/></p><p>安装minio</p><p>docker run -p 5080:9000 -p 5081:9001 --name hyj-minio \\\\</p><p>--restart=always \\\\</p><p>-e &quot;MINIO_ROOT_USER=minioadmin&quot; \\\\</p><p>-e &quot;MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=minioadmin&quot; \\\\</p><p>-v /data/minio/data:/data \\\\</p><p>-v /data/minio/config:/root/.minio \\\\</p><p>-d minio/minio server /data --console-address &quot;:9001&quot;</p><p><br/></p><p>已经执行的Docker命令：</p><p>后端</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-hyj.itdos.com:latest</p><p>docker run -e &quot;OsClient=hyj&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Hyj&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 5000:80 --name api-hyj.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-hyj.itdos.com:latest</p><p>前端</p><p>docker pull&nbsp;registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os-hyj-microi.itdos.com:latest</p><p>docker run -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 5001:80 --name os-hyj-microi.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os-hyj-microi.itdos.com:latest</p><p>系统大屏</p><p>docker pull&nbsp;registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os-hyj.itdos.com:latest</p><p>docker run -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 5002:80 --name os-hyj.itdos.com --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os-hyj.itdos.com:latest</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>// auth.itdos.com更新为auth.itdos.com.hyj</p><p>// 找一台空的服务器执行</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com</p><p>docker tag registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.hyj:latest</p><p>docker push registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.hyj:latest</p><p>// 海洋局服务器执行</p><p>docker rm -f auth.itdos.com</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.hyj:latest</p><p>docker run --name auth.itdos.com.hyj -itd -p 5007:80 --privileged=true --restart=always \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -e &quot;OsClient=hyj&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Hyj&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -e OsClientDbConn=&quot;Data Source=183.249.115.249;Database=itdos_hyj;User Id=root;Password=iTdos#mySql8;Port=3307;Convert Zero Datetime=True;Allow Zero Datetime=True;&quot; 