</p><p><br/></p><p>Docker</p><p>外网地址<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>59.110.139.96</p><p>内网地址<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span></p><p>用户名<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>docker login --username=admin@itdos.com registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com</p><p>密码<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>iTdos#docker.publish</p><p><br/></p><p>Redis</p><p>地址<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>59.110.139.96</p><p>端口<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>6380</p><p>密码<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>Onlyone2Redis</p><p><br/></p><p>Mysql</p><p>地址<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>59.110.139.96</p><p>端口<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>3307</p><p>账号<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>microi_parking</p><p>密码<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>WKz7rTwssPAHbkWe</p><p><br/></p><p>Mongodb</p><p>地址<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>59.110.139.96</p><p>端口<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>27018</p><p>账号<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>root</p><p>密码<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>itdos*osClient.20210321</p><p><br/></p><p>MinIO</p><p>地址<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>无</p><p>端口<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span></p><p>账号<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span></p><p>密码<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span></p><p><br/></p><p>已经执行的Docker命令：</p><p>后端</p><p>docker run -e &quot;OsClient=itdos&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Product&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1091:80 --name api-parking.microi.net --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-parking.microi.net:latest</p><p>微服务</p><p>docker run -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Product&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 1094:80 --name ms-parking.microi.net --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/ms-parking.microi.net:latest</p><p>后端(客户本地)</p><p>docker run -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internet&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts -itd -p 5000:80 --name api-parking.microi.net --privileged=true --restart=always registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-parking.microi.net:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>Docker执行命令</p><p>// auth.itdos.com更新为auth.itdos.com.parking</p><p>// 找一台空的服务器执行</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com</p><p>docker tag registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/auth.itdos.com registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>docker push registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>// 公司服务器执行</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>docker run --name auth.itdos.com.parking -itd -p 1087:80 --privileged=true --restart=always \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Product&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -e OsClientDbConn=&quot;Data Source=59.110.139.96;Database=microi_parking;User Id=microi_parking;Password=WKz7rTwssPAHbkWe;Port=3307;Convert Zero Datetime=true;Allow Zero Datetime=true;&quot; \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>// 客户192.168.11.251服务器执行</p><p>docker run --name auth.itdos.com.parking -itd -p 5007:80 --privileged=true --restart=always --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internet&quot; -e OsClientDbConn=&quot;Data Source=59.110.139.96;Database=microi_parking;User Id=microi_parking;Password=WKz7rTwssPAHbkWe;Port=3307;Convert Zero Datetime=true;Allow Zero Datetime=true;&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/auth.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>// api.itdos.com更新为api.itdos.com.parking</p><p>// 找一台空的服务器执行</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api.itdos.com</p><p>docker tag registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api.itdos.com registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/api.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>docker push registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/api.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>// 公司服务器执行</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/api.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>docker run --name api.itdos.com.parking -itd -p 1088:80 --privileged=true --restart=always \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Product&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internal&quot; \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -e OsClientDbConn=&quot;Data Source=59.110.139.96;Database=microi_parking;User Id=microi_parking;Password=WKz7rTwssPAHbkWe;Port=3307;Convert Zero Datetime=true;Allow Zero Datetime=true;&quot; \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/api.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>// 客户192.168.11.251服务器执行</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">docker run --name api.itdos.com.parking -itd -p 5006:80 --privileged=true --restart=always --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10&nbsp; -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientType=Parking&quot; -e &quot;OsClientNetwork=Internet&quot; -e OsClientDbConn=&quot;Data Source=59.110.139.96;Database=microi_parking;User Id=microi_parking;Password=WKz7rTwssPAHbkWe;Port=3307;Convert Zero Datetime=true;Allow Zero Datetime=true;&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/api.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>// os.itdos.com更新为os.itdos.com.parking</p><p>// 找一台空的服务器执行</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os.itdos.com</p><p>docker tag registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/os.itdos.com registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/os.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>docker push registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/os.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>// 公司服务器执行</p><p>docker pull registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/os.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>docker run --name os.itdos.com.parking -itd -p 1089:80 --privileged=true --restart=always \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;ApiBase=https://api-china-parking.microi.net&quot; \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts \\\\</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/os.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p>// 客户192.168.11.251服务器执行</p><p>docker run --name os.itdos.com.parking -itd -p 5005:80 --privileged=true --restart=always --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 -e &quot;OsClient=parking&quot; -e &quot;ApiBase=http://192.168.11.251:5006&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/os.itdos.com.parking:latest</p><p><br/></p><p>------2023-05-19</p><p>192.168.11.251服务器挂掉，需要将2套程序在192.168.11.250上重新部署。</p><p>250最新始无法ping域名，是因为网络配置文件DNS被谁写成了NDS。后来无法下载docker是因为repo没配置好。</p><p>目前已执行docker：</p><p>#docker login --username=admin@itdos.com --password=iTdos#docker.publish registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com</p><p>#docker pull&nbsp;registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-parking.microi.net</p><p>#docker run --name api-parking.microi.net -itd -p 5000:80 --privileged=true --restart=always --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 -e &quot;OsClient=Parking&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/itdos/api-parking.microi.net:latest</p><p><br/></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">#docker pull&nbsp;registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/microi.parkinglot.webui</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">#docker run --name microi.parkinglot.webui -itd -p 5001:80 --privileged=true --restart=always --log-opt max-size=10m --log-opt max-file=10 -e &quot;OsClient=Parking&quot; -v /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime -v /usr/share/fonts:/usr/share/fonts registry.cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/microi/microi.parkinglot.webui:latest</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><br/></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><br/></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://parking.microi.net/#/\\\">https://parking.microi.net/#/</a>&nbsp; 里面配置的TakingNoUrl&nbsp; 叫号系统是<a href=\\\"http://192.168.11.251:5010，但这个只是做了一个反向代理：202.102.128.32:9109\\\">http://192.168.11.251:5010，但这个只是做了一个反向代理：202.102.128.32:9109</a> </p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">所以后来改成了202.102.128.32:9109。 里面的HikVisionEventReturnUrl也从251改成了250</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\"><br/></p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">登陆海康后台地址：</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">http://192.168.11.250:8001/center</p><p style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">用户sysadmin密码hik12345-</p><p>状态监控--API网关--API管理</p><p><a href=\\\"http://192.168.11.250:9017/artemis-web/statistic/index\\\">http://192.168.11.250:9017/artemis-web/statistic/index</a> </p><p><br/></p><p>251的程序换到250后，需要调用api-parking里面的接口卸载之前的海康订阅，然后重新注册订阅。</p><p><br/></p><p>-----2024-04-01迁移：</p><p>1、<a href=\\\"https://os.jinhuitingcc.com/#/CommonConfig\\\">https://os.jinhuitingcc.com/#/CommonConfig</a>&nbsp; 里面的HikVisionEventReturnUrl值从【http://192.168.11.250:5000/ReceiveHikVision/Receive】修改为【http://192.168.11.251:5000/ReceiveHikVision/Receive】，修改后需要进redis删除db3里面的Parking_DIyCOmmonConfig缓存，然后重启后端定制接口docker</p><p>2、访问【<a href=\\\"https://api-park.jinhuitingcc.com/swagger/index.html】，执行/ReceiveHikVision/UnSubscribeEvents接口\\\">https://api-park.jinhuitingcc.com/swagger/index.html】，执行/ReceiveHikVision/UnSubscribeEvents接口</a> </p><p>3、稍等10秒左右，执行【/ReceiveHikVision/SubscribeEvents】接口</p><p>4、去<a href=\\\"http://192.168.11.250:9017/artemis-web/statistic/index\\\" style=\\\"white-space: normal;\\\">http://192.168.11.250:9017/artemis-web/statistic/index</a>【用户sysadmin密码hik12345-】查看是否取消和注册成功</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\",\"ZhanghaoMM\":\"<p>停车场项目比较特殊，因为客户服务器无法开放外网443端口，导致无法把项目完全部署到客户服务器。现在是客户服务器运行闸机相关的程序，我们服务器跑小程序，客户服务器远程连接我们Mysql、Redis、Mongodb回写数据这么在操作的。</p><p>阿里云账号密码：<br/></p><p>aliyun1570277174</p><p>jinhui2024</p><p><br/></p><p>停车场域名：<br/>jinhuitingcc.com</p><p><br/></p><p>网址：parking.microi.net</p><p>用户名：admin</p><p>密码：1234567 （后来修改弱口令，改成了：Park123#Micori456!）</p><p><br/></p><p>Git地址：</p><p>后端<span style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t</span>http://git.itdos.net:99/wangweidi/DangerParkingLot</p><p>微服务 http://git.itdos.net:99/wangweidi/microi.service.parking</p><p>小程序 http://git.itdos.net:99/Shuxinxin/parking-uniapp</p><p><br/></p><p>swagger</p><p><a href=\\\"https://api-parking.microi.net/swagger/index.html\\\">https://api-parking.microi.net/swagger/index.html</a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>----2023-11-04出现整个程序全部崩掉，</p><p>#docker restart api-parking.microi.net&nbsp; &nbsp;对应后端定制开发：https://api-parking.microi.net/swagger/index.html</p><p>#docker restart&nbsp;api.itdos.com.parking&nbsp; &nbsp;对应访问os：<a href=\\\"https://parking.microi.net\\\">https://parking.microi.net</a>&nbsp;的api接口系统：<span style=\\\"color: #303942; font-family: Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://api-china-parking.microi.net\\\">https://api-china-parking.microi.net</a></span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: #303942; font-family: Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"> </span><br/></p><p><span style=\\\"color:#303942;font-family:Menlo, monospace\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">----20240327---迁移到他们本地251服务器</span></span></p><p><span style=\\\"color:#303942;font-family:Menlo, monospace\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><a href=\\\"http://58.58.111.26/\\\">http://58.58.111.26</a><a href=\\\"http://192.168.11.251:12282/7982e52c02\\\" style=\\\"font-family: Menlo, monospace; text-wrap: wrap;\\\">:12282/7982e52c02</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\\\"color:#303942;font-family:Menlo, monospace\\\"><a href=\\\"http://192.168.11.251:12282/7982e52c02\\\">http://192.168.11.251:12282/7982e52c02</a> </span></p><p><br/></p><p>用户名：5568f522ab</p><p>用户密码: 396e32b1aa</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\\\"color:#303942;font-family:Menlo, monospace\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 11px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"></span></span></p><p>OS:</p><p><a href=\\\"https://os.jinhuitingcc.com\\\">https://os.jinhuitingcc.com</a> </p><p>admin&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\">Park123#Micori456!</span></p><p>API:</p><p><a href=\\\"https://api.jinhuitingcc.com\\\">https://api.jinhuitingcc.com</a> </p><p>定制前端</p><p><a href=\\\"https://os-parking.jinhuitingcc.com\\\">https://os-park.jinhuitingcc.com</a> </p><p><br/></p><p>定制后端：</p><p><a href=\\\"https://api-park.jinhuitingcc.com\\\">https://api-park.jinhuitingcc.com</a> </p><p><br/></p><p>MYSQL:</p><p>58.58.111.26:3307 外网/ 192.168.11.251:3306 内网</p><p>root&nbsp; mysql_BzjdNQ</p><p><br/></p><p>REDIS:</p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\">192.168.11.251:6379</span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\">jhkdjhkjdhsIUTYURTU_ZK3Dp7</span></span></p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\"><br/></span></span></p><p>minio:</p><p><span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\">192.168.11.251:9000&nbsp; &nbsp;/&nbsp;<span style=\\\"text-wrap: wrap;\\\">192.168.11.251:9001 ap